flowchart LR
    Staff[Merchant staff]
    Buyer[Wholesale buyer contact]
    App[B2B A/R Collections Assistant]
    Shopify[Shopify Admin + Partner APIs]
    Postmark[Postmark transactional email]
    Ops[Product operator]
    Telemetry[Redacted observability]

    Staff -->|Embedded UI, approved actions| App
    App -->|Aging, queue, history, controls| Staff
    Shopify -->|GraphQL truth, webhooks, sessions, plans| App
    App -->|Scoped queries and subscription verification| Shopify
    App -->|Approved reminder or statement| Postmark
    Postmark -->|Email| Buyer
    Postmark -->|Delivery, bounce, complaint events| App
    Ops -->|Audited diagnostics and recovery| App
    App -->|Metrics, structured logs, errors; no content| Telemetry
